WEBVTT

00:00.507 --> 00:02.776
This excavation will be conducted on
Okinodoku Island located at the edge of Japan.

00:02.776 --> 00:05.011
This excavation will be conducted on
Okinodoku Island located at the edge of Japan.

00:05.011 --> 00:06.780
I'll explain the details at the site.

00:06.780 --> 00:07.114
I'll explain the details at the site.

00:07.114 --> 00:08.415
It'd be great if I could have your help.

00:08.415 --> 00:09.182
It'd be great if I could have your help.

00:09.182 --> 00:10.317
I'll be waiting for you.

00:10.317 --> 00:10.383
I'll be waiting for you.

00:10.383 --> 00:11.218
Here you go.

00:11.218 --> 00:12.481
Ah, thanks.

00:18.992 --> 00:21.628
I know it's sudden, but it's
summer vacation, meow.

00:24.631 --> 00:29.169
The archaeology professor who looked after me
during my college days contacted me,

00:29.169 --> 00:32.537
and now I'm rushing to get there to
help him with the excavation research.

00:35.075 --> 00:39.546
This excavation will be conducted on
Okinodoku Island located at the end of Japan.

00:39.546 --> 00:41.742
I'll explain the details at the site. I'll be...

00:42.749 --> 00:44.785
What a pain...

00:44.785 --> 00:45.252
Hmm?

00:46.353 --> 00:46.979
Kappa?!

00:47.821 --> 00:51.525
I hadn't watched the message until
the very end before, so I didn't notice...

00:52.325 --> 00:53.622
Is it his assistant?

01:19.119 --> 01:21.053
Sh-She's alive!

01:21.555 --> 01:23.853
That shocked the hell out of me!

01:25.125 --> 01:27.227
I thought I was going to die.

01:27.227 --> 01:28.195
Tee heel

01:28.195 --> 01:29.890
"Tee hee"?

01:32.199 --> 01:34.668
You must be Miss Rebecca Miyamoto.

01:34.668 --> 01:37.504
I'm the Professor's assistant, Media.

01:37.504 --> 01:39.172
I've come to pick you up.

01:39.172 --> 01:40.307
Pick me up?

01:40.307 --> 01:41.536
Yes.

01:42.676 --> 01:45.912
Oh my goodness. I wonder what happened?

01:45.912 --> 01:49.049
YOU DID IT!

02:00.594 --> 02:00.827
Maho!

02:00.827 --> 02:01.828
Maho!

02:08.668 --> 02:12.873
Roll cake Sunday, sandwich Monday

02:12.873 --> 02:16.743
Just go with how you feel

02:16.743 --> 02:20.881
Half in expectation and even in odds

02:20.881 --> 02:24.484
Tomorrow starts now

02:24.484 --> 02:25.752
Cats

02:25.752 --> 02:26.453
Cats

02:26.453 --> 02:27.721
And silver grass

02:27.721 --> 02:28.388
And silver grass

02:28.388 --> 02:32.492
Are beckoning

02:32.492 --> 02:33.660
There's nothing

02:33.660 --> 02:34.427
There's nothing

02:34.427 --> 02:35.662
It's boring

02:35.662 --> 02:36.363
It's boring

02:36.363 --> 02:40.322
Goodbye for today

02:41.801 --> 02:44.304
It goes around, goes round and round

02:44.304 --> 02:45.739
It goes around, goes round and round

02:45.739 --> 02:48.241
I'm the Sun

02:48.241 --> 02:49.743
I'm the Sun

02:49.743 --> 02:52.178
It goes around, goes round and round

02:52.178 --> 02:53.680
It goes around, goes round and round

02:53.680 --> 02:56.116
Even the green train, too

02:56.116 --> 02:57.450
Even the green train, too

02:57.450 --> 03:00.053
It goes around, goes round and round

03:00.053 --> 03:01.554
It goes around, goes round and round

03:01.554 --> 03:03.989
It keeps on spinning

03:05.492 --> 03:17.003
Even the sky and the stars are a roulette theater

03:17.003 --> 03:18.334
Huh?

03:24.577 --> 03:28.048
Please wake up, Miss Miyamoto. We're here.

03:28.048 --> 03:28.214
Okinodoku Island!

03:28.214 --> 03:28.815
Okinodoku Island!

03:28.815 --> 03:29.249
Okinodoku Island!

03:29.249 --> 03:29.749
Okinodoku Island!

03:29.749 --> 03:30.450
Okinodoku Island!

03:30.884 --> 03:33.012
You're tougher than you look, aren't you?

03:34.654 --> 03:36.056
Anyway, Media.

03:36.056 --> 03:36.890
Yes?

03:36.890 --> 03:38.551
Why are you wearing a maid outfit?

03:43.330 --> 03:45.958
Because I'm an assistant.

03:46.933 --> 03:47.661
Huh?

03:48.401 --> 03:51.871
At any rate, this is one
suspicious-looking island.

03:51.871 --> 03:54.808
Not really. We even have a convenience
store and stuff, too.

03:54.808 --> 03:56.276
A convenience store?!

03:57.410 --> 03:59.212
Thank you!

04:01.448 --> 04:02.482
It's true...

04:02.482 --> 04:04.651
Everyone's waiting inside.

04:04.651 --> 04:06.419
Huh? Everyone?

04:06.453 --> 04:06.619
Huh? Becky!

04:06.619 --> 04:08.021
Huh? Becky!

04:08.021 --> 04:08.288
Huh? Becky!

04:08.288 --> 04:09.689
Becky's here, everyone!

04:09.689 --> 04:10.290
Becky's here, everyone!

04:10.290 --> 04:11.491
Hi-Himeko?!

04:11.491 --> 04:12.759
Oh yeah.

04:13.994 --> 04:16.029
What are you guys doing here?!

04:16.029 --> 04:17.964
The Professor invited them.

04:17.964 --> 04:20.934
He said, "In traveling, companionship,
in life, compassion."

04:20.934 --> 04:23.036
I don't think this is a good example of that.

04:23.036 --> 04:23.770
Mahon!

04:23.770 --> 04:24.738
Mahon!

04:24.738 --> 04:24.897
Mahon!

04:25.038 --> 04:29.305
I couldn't see you because of summer vacation,
and I've omega-missed you!

04:29.476 --> 04:31.644
I'll never let you go, okay?!

04:31.644 --> 04:34.214
Get away from me, you omega-idiot! It's hot!

04:34.214 --> 04:34.614
Well, now that Becky's here,
why don't we go back to the search?

04:34.614 --> 04:37.517
Well, now that Becky's here,
why don't we go back to the search?

04:37.517 --> 04:39.819
Search? Search for who?

04:39.819 --> 04:40.620
Mesousa.

04:40.620 --> 04:40.882
Mesousa.

04:41.488 --> 04:43.757
He was with us up until a little while ago, but...

04:43.757 --> 04:45.692
He got taken away by something...

04:46.693 --> 04:49.390
The bunny will get to marry
a rich person, won't he?

04:50.263 --> 04:51.931
Why marry a rich person?

04:51.931 --> 04:53.433
Don't ask yourself a question.

04:53.433 --> 04:56.169
Since this island is sort of undeveloped,

04:56.169 --> 04:59.139
every now and then you run
into some rare creatures.

04:59.139 --> 05:02.042
So maybe he was abducted by
something like that!

05:02.042 --> 05:02.142
What do you mean, "sort of undeveloped"?

05:02.142 --> 05:04.511
What do you mean, "sort of undeveloped"?

05:04.511 --> 05:07.280
And what rare creatures are you
talking about, anyway?

05:07.280 --> 05:09.783
Look what I found earlier!

05:11.251 --> 05:12.218
What's up?

05:16.556 --> 05:18.591
What's your problem? He's so cute.

05:18.591 --> 05:19.854
What's up?

05:22.162 --> 05:24.426
Wow, what pretty flowers!

05:24.664 --> 05:27.467
Hondara handara sukadoroba!

05:27.467 --> 05:30.203
Leave me alone if you want to survive.

05:30.203 --> 05:33.273
I'll burn you, crush you and swallow you up.

05:33.273 --> 05:36.834
I'm here to stay for generations to come!

05:36.943 --> 05:38.044
Tee hee!

05:38.044 --> 05:39.579
Tee hee?

05:39.579 --> 05:42.082
What kind of song was that?

05:42.082 --> 05:43.817
A lullaby.

05:43.817 --> 05:46.920
I'd love to meet a kid who could
fall asleep with that song.

05:46.920 --> 05:49.089
Whoa! What the heck is that?!

05:49.089 --> 05:54.294
Yaay! I see all kinds of weird-
looking animals! I'm happy!

05:54.294 --> 05:56.956
Maho! They're cute!

06:10.577 --> 06:14.172
There are a bunch of dangerous animals
as well, so please be careful!

06:16.749 --> 06:18.084
You should've said that sooner!

06:18.084 --> 06:20.220
Is this place really Japan?

06:20.220 --> 06:21.847
Anyway, let's be careful!

06:22.122 --> 06:23.385
Tee hee!

06:24.724 --> 06:28.795
It was in this area that Mesousa
disappeared, wasn't it?

06:28.795 --> 06:30.730
In this area, huh?

06:30.730 --> 06:34.300
Hey, what kind of creature was it
that abducted him?

06:34.300 --> 06:37.237
Actually, we didn't see it.

06:37.237 --> 06:40.507
Miss Ichijo is the only witness.

06:40.507 --> 06:43.910
Why did the most confusing one see it?

06:43.910 --> 06:45.605
There's one more witness.

06:48.681 --> 06:50.316
Where did you just take her out from?!

06:50.316 --> 06:52.519
Don't worry about it. It's Ichijo, you know.

06:52.519 --> 06:53.816
It bothers me!

06:54.354 --> 06:55.288
Maho!

06:55.288 --> 06:57.524
She's making a composite sketch
of the suspect who abducted him.

06:57.524 --> 07:00.460
I wonder what kind of creature it is?
I can't wait to see!

07:01.761 --> 07:03.096
What? A UFO?

07:03.096 --> 07:03.496
What? A UFO?

07:03.496 --> 07:06.299
I'm sorry. It's Miss Miyamoto.

07:06.299 --> 07:07.367
I don't get it.

07:07.367 --> 07:07.467
Maho!

07:07.467 --> 07:07.867
Maho!

07:07.867 --> 07:09.035
Maho!

07:09.035 --> 07:11.804
So it was Becky who abducted Mesousa!

07:11.804 --> 07:11.971
So it was Becky who abducted Mesousa!

07:11.971 --> 07:14.474
Huh? So does that mean Becky is an alien?

07:14.474 --> 07:14.908
Huh? So does that mean Becky is an alien?

07:14.908 --> 07:18.478
Wait, but she showed up after Mesousa
was abducted, didn't she?

07:18.478 --> 07:21.080
Huh? How did she abduct him, then?

07:21.080 --> 07:21.114
Hey, maybe she used supernatural powers?

07:21.114 --> 07:23.216
Hey, maybe she used supernatural powers?

07:23.216 --> 07:24.951
So Becky has ESP?

07:24.951 --> 07:26.119
Maho! That's jet-awesome!

07:26.119 --> 07:27.787
Maho! That's jet-awesome!

07:27.787 --> 07:30.085
Someone do something with this idiot.

07:34.561 --> 07:36.429
Oh, she put her back in there.

07:36.429 --> 07:38.998
Like I said, don't sweat the small stuff.

07:38.998 --> 07:41.734
Everyone, I've got news for you!

07:41.734 --> 07:44.170
I found the bunny!

07:44.170 --> 07:45.797
Really?

07:48.107 --> 07:53.705
Ah, please help me, everyone. I beg of you.

07:54.047 --> 07:55.281
Th-They talked...

07:55.415 --> 07:57.283
Mesousa became a part of the tree!

07:57.283 --> 07:59.052
And there are so many of him...

07:59.052 --> 08:02.388
Mesousa is growing in bunches of the year.

08:02.388 --> 08:03.523
This is insane...

08:03.523 --> 08:05.558
There's no way stuff like this can happen!

08:05.558 --> 08:07.527
I don't believe this!

08:07.694 --> 08:09.028
I'll kick your butt if you don't believe me.

08:09.028 --> 08:11.097
I'm serious! GRRRR!

08:11.097 --> 08:11.431
I'm serious! GRRRR!

08:11.431 --> 08:12.732
Calm down, Miyako.

08:12.732 --> 08:14.734
She's right. This is a jungle, remember?

08:14.734 --> 08:16.603
STOP TALKING NONSENSE!

08:16.803 --> 08:18.972
Media, what's going on?

08:18.972 --> 08:20.506
What's with that tree?

08:20.506 --> 08:22.976
It's a yummy-yummy bunny tree.

08:22.976 --> 08:25.345
Please, keep your mouth shut!

08:25.345 --> 08:27.447
I don't know exactly how it worked,

08:27.447 --> 08:27.513
but one time the Professor grew in bunches,

08:27.513 --> 08:29.849
but one time the Professor grew in bunches,

08:29.849 --> 08:33.319
and when I picked the one I thought was the
real Professor, all the other ones disappeared.

08:33.319 --> 08:34.387
The real one?

08:34.387 --> 08:37.824
Does that mean only one is the real him,
and all the others are fake?

08:37.824 --> 08:39.492
We have to look for the real one, huh?

08:39.492 --> 08:41.517
Becky, you can tell which one is real, right?

08:42.795 --> 08:46.666
To tell you the truth, I've never really had
a good look at Mesousa's face before...

08:46.666 --> 08:47.934
Oh no...

08:47.934 --> 08:49.493
Please pick the right one.

08:49.736 --> 08:52.005
Just say, "This one!" and pick one. It'll be okay!

08:52.305 --> 08:53.873
What do you mean, "It'll be okay"?

08:53.873 --> 08:56.075
What will happen if she picks the wrong one?

08:56.075 --> 08:59.779
Supposedly, every one of them,
including the real one, will wither away.

08:59.779 --> 09:01.180
All right, let's pick the wrong one then!

09:01.180 --> 09:02.181
Why?

09:02.315 --> 09:04.550
Don't you want to see that?
It's called having an inquiring mind!

09:04.550 --> 09:05.585
It's curiosity, isn't it?

09:05.585 --> 09:07.287
Please help me.

09:07.287 --> 09:09.722
I beg of you!

09:09.722 --> 09:12.054
Raise your hand if you think you're the real one!

09:12.992 --> 09:14.927
No use...

09:14.927 --> 09:16.596
All right, I'll make a guess!

09:16.596 --> 09:16.996
All right, I'll make a guess!

09:16.996 --> 09:17.797
Maho!

09:17.797 --> 09:19.299
You're so cool, Becky!

09:19.299 --> 09:19.765
You're so cool, Becky!

09:26.039 --> 09:28.041
Sure enough, THAT one caught her attention...

09:28.041 --> 09:30.442
Hello there! I'm the real one!

09:31.577 --> 09:32.145
She picked one.

09:32.145 --> 09:34.842
No way!

09:37.750 --> 09:39.085
Thank you!

09:39.085 --> 09:41.587
I'll never forget your kindness, Rebecca!

09:41.587 --> 09:43.189
Don't mention it.

09:43.189 --> 09:44.524
Are you sure that's the real one?

09:44.524 --> 09:46.225
It doesn't matter. The other ones
are gone anyway.

09:46.225 --> 09:47.393
It must be the real one.

09:47.393 --> 09:48.328
But still...

09:48.328 --> 09:50.129
Now let the adventure begin!

09:50.129 --> 09:55.568
Now that we've found the bunny,
let's-la-go to see the Professor!

09:55.568 --> 09:58.338
Please follow me and try not to
get separated, okay?

09:58.338 --> 10:00.273
What's "Let's-la-go"?

10:00.273 --> 10:01.407
Dunno.

10:01.407 --> 10:05.378
By the way, what did you get abducted by
to end up being up there?

10:05.378 --> 10:06.946
Was it an unidentified creature?

10:06.946 --> 10:09.482
No, it's hard to admit, but it was a human.

10:09.482 --> 10:10.717
A human?

10:10.717 --> 10:12.651
That's right. It was her!

10:13.419 --> 10:14.554
You, huh?

10:14.554 --> 10:16.255
That's right! It was me!

10:16.255 --> 10:18.091
You don't have to do it, too!

10:18.091 --> 10:20.026
Come on, everyone!

10:20.026 --> 10:23.428
We're going inside! Please come!

10:23.930 --> 10:25.631
What? A cave?

10:25.631 --> 10:27.867
Oh no, I don't like dark places!

10:27.867 --> 10:29.168
Me, either!

10:29.168 --> 10:31.337
Don't worry! I'm with you!

10:31.337 --> 10:31.404
Don't worry! I'm with you!

10:31.404 --> 10:31.637
Yaay! Expedition! Expedition!

10:31.637 --> 10:33.673
Yaay! Expedition! Expedition!

10:33.673 --> 10:36.642
Look at that idiot... She's so cheerful.

10:36.642 --> 10:38.544
I'd LOVE to be an idiot, too.

10:38.544 --> 10:39.312
Then why don't you be one?

10:39.312 --> 10:39.912
Then why don't you be one?

10:40.880 --> 10:42.041
Then don't say that.

10:42.315 --> 10:42.815
Maho, maho, maho...

10:42.815 --> 10:46.342
Maho, maho, maho...

10:48.087 --> 10:49.122
What's going on?

10:49.122 --> 10:51.858
Oh yeah, I forgot to mention this,

10:51.858 --> 10:55.795
but there's a bottomless swamp
by the entrance, so be careful!

10:55.795 --> 10:57.024
Huh?

10:58.264 --> 11:01.134
You should've said that SOONER!

11:01.134 --> 11:03.302
Maho! We're sinking! We're sinking!

11:03.302 --> 11:04.704
Oh my, we've got a problem.

11:04.704 --> 11:06.305
What's up with your carefree attitude?

11:06.305 --> 11:08.741
Get a rope, Media! Come on, throw me a rope!

11:08.741 --> 11:09.976
I don't have one.

11:09.976 --> 11:10.076
I don't have one.

11:10.076 --> 11:11.411
What did you just say?

11:12.879 --> 11:14.438
Help us!

11:21.487 --> 11:22.889
Wh-Where are we?

11:22.889 --> 11:25.658
We did fall into the
bottomless swamp, didn't we?

11:25.658 --> 11:26.959
Yeah, we did...

11:26.959 --> 11:28.394
Since it's bottomless...

11:28.394 --> 11:30.021
We kept falling and...

11:31.364 --> 11:31.464
BRAZIL?!

11:31.464 --> 11:33.466
BRAZIL?!

11:44.644 --> 11:48.114
I see! Sounds like it was one hell of a
journey to get here, Rebecca.

11:48.114 --> 11:50.450
It's not funny, Professor!

11:50.450 --> 11:51.884
I thought we were going to die.

11:51.884 --> 11:53.719
Thank god Ichijo was with us.

11:53.719 --> 11:55.488
Thank you, Miss Ichijo.

11:55.488 --> 11:57.690
I really want to thank you for this one.

11:57.690 --> 12:00.159
Oh, you're welcome.

12:00.493 --> 12:03.394
Please have some, everyone. It's good.

12:04.063 --> 12:05.231
That's cool!

12:05.231 --> 12:08.100
Media has a mysterious history.

12:08.100 --> 12:09.969
Mysterious history?

12:09.969 --> 12:10.903
Tee hee!

12:10.903 --> 12:12.071
Tee hee?

12:12.071 --> 12:13.506
Mahohohoho...

12:13.506 --> 12:15.908
Are you okay, Himeko?

12:15.908 --> 12:18.172
I danced too much, and now my back hurts.

12:19.145 --> 12:21.481
Would you like me to give you
a massage, young lady?

12:21.481 --> 12:21.914
I'd love that!

12:21.914 --> 12:22.281
I'd love that!

12:22.281 --> 12:22.648
I'd love that!

12:22.648 --> 12:22.949
I'd love that!

12:24.917 --> 12:26.886
She's a downright peaceful idiot.

12:26.886 --> 12:28.154
I'd LOVE to be an idiot, too.

12:28.154 --> 12:28.888
I'd LOVE to be an idiot, too.

12:28.888 --> 12:29.622
Then why don't you be one?

12:29.622 --> 12:30.456
No way!

12:30.456 --> 12:31.753
Then don't say that.

12:32.291 --> 12:35.695
Anyway Professor, when do you
think this is from?

12:35.695 --> 12:37.997
It's probably from the 2nd century.

12:37.997 --> 12:40.266
It definitely does look like it's
from the Yayoi Period.

12:40.266 --> 12:43.436
But in a way, it has characteristics of
ancient China's style, too...

12:43.436 --> 12:48.207
Well, some say Yayoi culture originated
from the Yangtze River area

12:48.207 --> 12:50.142
and considering the fact that there's
a record in the Account of the Wa People

12:50.142 --> 12:55.047
of a Chinese copper mirror being excavated
in the Ihara Yarimizo district in Fukuoka,

12:55.047 --> 12:56.215
I guess it's not surprising.

12:56.215 --> 12:57.583
That's what I'm thinking.

12:57.583 --> 13:01.621
Anyway, I want you to determine the age
of the excavated articles.

13:01.621 --> 13:03.521
Bleh, that sounds like a pain in the butt.

13:04.123 --> 13:05.925
Hmm? What's up, Himeko?

13:05.925 --> 13:07.093
Mamahomahoma...

13:07.093 --> 13:07.527
Mamahomahoma...

13:07.527 --> 13:08.361
What?

13:08.361 --> 13:09.896
Mahomahoho...

13:09.896 --> 13:11.430
She's broken.

13:11.430 --> 13:15.568
She's in shock because you said all that
complicated stuff like it was nothing.

13:15.568 --> 13:18.671
Huh? I didn't say anything that complicated!

13:18.738 --> 13:21.274
Hey, Himeko, snap out of it.

13:24.010 --> 13:25.478
Hi-Himeko?

13:25.478 --> 13:28.573
Don't worry, she'll be back to normal
before you know it.

13:31.250 --> 13:32.251
Himeko Katagiri, reborn!

13:32.251 --> 13:33.386
Himeko Katagiri, reborn!

13:34.654 --> 13:35.755
I don't get it...

13:35.755 --> 13:36.088
I don't get it...

13:36.088 --> 13:38.391
All right, I'm going to eat meat!

13:38.391 --> 13:39.625
Mahoi!

13:39.625 --> 13:42.026
Oh well, she seems back to normal,
so I guess it's okay.

13:44.931 --> 13:47.600
The Earth Base is so homey.

13:47.600 --> 13:51.037
There's nothing like standing
on the ground, wouldn't you say?

13:51.037 --> 13:54.337
Captain, why don't we stay for a while?

13:56.008 --> 13:57.476
Looks like you're having fun.

13:57.476 --> 14:00.446
This is a rare opportunity to enjoy being
on the ground! You should enjoy it, too!

14:00.446 --> 14:02.574
No, I'm fine.

14:10.456 --> 14:12.258
Mmmm, this is delicious!

14:12.258 --> 14:15.828
