15:00.339 --> 15:03.309
Oh, when she was in school? Let's see...

15:03.309 --> 15:05.344
Normal. I was normal.

15:05.344 --> 15:05.511
Normal. I was normal.

15:05.511 --> 15:08.447
Well, she was a normal genius.

15:08.447 --> 15:10.650
