15:10.650 --> 15:13.219
Normal! Normal! Just a normal student!

15:13.219 --> 15:14.620
That's it! The end!

15:14.620 --> 15:14.720
We have pictures from back then!

15:14.720 --> 15:16.989
We have pictures from back then!

15:16.989 --> 15:17.012
We have pictures from back then!

15:18.758 --> 15:19.759
Let me see it!

15:19.759 --> 15:21.260
