happened only during her college days.

16:09.575 --> 16:13.307
It happened on the day of a certain
scientific experiment.

16:13.713 --> 16:17.450
An unexpected mistake caused her
to fuse with a cat and...

16:17.450 --> 16:19.351
Oh my god, meow!

16:19.351 --> 16:20.720
YOU LIAR!

16:20.720 --> 16:22.822
Don't you go dramatizing things!

16:22.822 --> 16:23.622
Bummer, so it's not true.

16:23.622 --> 16:24.356
Bummer, so it's not true.

16:25.091 --> 16:26.926
Don't say "too bad," No. 6!

16:26.926 --> 16:28.494
