16:28.494 --> 16:29.928
Yeah.

16:31.230 --> 16:33.933
This was taken when she came to my lab.

16:33.933 --> 16:35.634
And this was taken during an experiment.

16:35.634 --> 16:37.466
And this was taken when she was reading.

16:37.636 --> 16:38.471
Oh man...

16:38.471 --> 16:39.872
Look at how grumpy she looks!

16:39.872 --> 16:41.841
She's giving off a dark aura, big time.

16:41.841 --> 16:43.969
When it goes that far, it gets kinda scary.

16:44.777 --> 16:46.946
Just kill me and get it over with!

16:46.946 --> 16:48.147
I can't see it.

16:48.147 --> 16:51.517
That's right. Rebecca never
showed her emotions.

16:51.517 --> 16:54.053
No, it was more like she couldn't.

16:54.053 --> 16:56.756
The only thing she ever showed
interest in was studying.

16:56.756 --> 16:59.859
She had a sharp mind,
she was indeed a genius,

16:59.859 --> 17:04.353
but her exclusive attitude
isolated her from other people.

17:05.998 --> 17:08.534
Poor Becky!

17:08.534 --> 17:11.637
I was dying to see her smile, no matter what.

17:11.637 --> 17:13.539
So I came up with a plan.

17:13.539 --> 17:14.406
A plan?

17:14.406 --> 17:15.741
What did you do?

17:15.741 --> 17:17.777
Told her a story!

17:17.777 --> 17:19.006
A story?

17:21.747 --> 17:25.918
One day, a poor mouse asked
an elephant that had become rich,

17:25.918 --> 17:25.985
One day, a poor mouse asked
an elephant that had become rich,

17:25.985 --> 17:28.521
"How did you get so rich?"

17:28.521 --> 17:30.089
The Elephant replied,

17:30.089 --> 17:33.993
"Because I worked hard.
It doesn't take a genius to work."

17:33.993 --> 17:35.661
Then the Mouse said,

17:35.661 --> 17:38.631
"Okay, then I'll work really hard
and become rich, too!"

17:38.831 --> 17:40.833
