right after she heard that story.

17:46.038 --> 17:47.106
She's smiling...

17:47.106 --> 17:49.097
But it's kinda scary...

17:50.042 --> 17:54.079
So after that, you two became close,
didn't you, Professor?

17:54.079 --> 17:57.383
Right. I'd call her "Beckers"
and she'd call me "Prof fie."

17:57.383 --> 18:00.452
I never called you that, not even once!

18:00.452 --> 18:03.122
You're so awkward, you know that?

18:03.122 --> 18:08.617
I went to MIT to study,
not to hang out with friends!

18:09.461 --> 18:11.190
Yeah, yeah.

18:11.363 --> 18:12.398
