18:12.398 --> 18:14.633
I'm sorry, but could you untie me, too?

18:14.633 --> 18:16.769
Maho!

18:16.769 --> 18:18.771
I love you just the way you are
right now, Becky!

18:18.771 --> 18:22.107
You don't smile a lot, and you go off easily, but...

18:22.107 --> 18:23.509
I love you!

18:23.509 --> 18:25.311
